int、build、verify_spec通过。远端CI待本次head实际运行，不能以本地结果替代。\n- 可回读证据：`progress/evidence/2026-09-15/M5.3-final-*`及`M5.3-fixed-source-gates`；838输入与Git逐项绑定。native仅4张既有PNG直接输出，44个顶层UI原文件预存/after保留/精确恢复，原unchanged=false保留。\n- 运行截图：`progress/evidence/2026-09-15/M5.3-ui-development/final-native/`，含1440及390宽真实受控回答/恢复；原移动抽屉harness失败与后续修正分别保留。\n- 安全与公开审阅：原消息缺失、Policy409清正文、跨页丢ACK、安全Jobs投影/原取消ACK、模型帮助和坏Job调度的实际失败及修复证据分别保留。新增内容为本项目源码、原创合成测试和脱敏工程证据；不包含用户密钥、真实学习资料或运行数据库。\n- 未运行与下一任务：生产完整InputProof仍未注册，DeepSeek平台端到端、真实搜索、Codex和学习效果NOT_RUN。独立DeepSeek 15-token冒烟与受控loopback软件流程分列。M5.4继续可信目的地/版本绑定、显式无thinking请求和完整计量审计；已有测试授权无需重复申请。\n\n本PR保持draft/open；审查批准及检查通过后方可合并、关闭Issue。\n","created_at":"2026-09-15T14:53:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T14:53:27Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"771734fa5d455d4bcc8ec0b866a1b8dd59b8f3fa","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/51/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/51/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/51/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/statuses/70b0278a755c7cd924b3c26afeff4f65196a4a79","head":{"label":"kl3574:feat/M5.3-tutor-runs","ref":"feat/M5.3-tutor-runs","sha":"70b0278a755c7cd924b3c26afeff4f65196a4a79","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/gists{/gist_id}",